{"schema":1,"docId":"constitution","locale":"zh","contentVersion":"legal-lab-2026-10-15.2","id":6,"start":384,"units":[{"id":"constitution-u00c2638b29e70f2411-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"俄罗斯联邦总统：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第83条 · “俄罗斯联邦总统：”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u79aa4edf8e7cc7f95c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"а) 任命由俄罗斯联邦总统提名并经国家杜马批准其人选的俄罗斯联邦政府主席，并解除俄罗斯联邦政府主席职务；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«а»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u00415426e5324ad09b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"б) 对俄罗斯联邦政府实行总体领导；有权主持俄罗斯联邦政府会议；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«б»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud35763235d8472a7fb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"б.1) 根据俄罗斯联邦政府主席的建议，批准联邦行政机关结构并进行调整；在该结构中确定由俄罗斯联邦总统领导其活动的机关和由俄罗斯联邦政府领导其活动的机关。如俄罗斯联邦政府主席被俄罗斯联邦总统免职，新任政府主席不向俄罗斯联邦总统提交有关联邦行政机关结构的建议；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«б»项 第83条 · “б.1) 根据俄罗斯联邦政府主席的建议，批准联邦行政机关结构并进行调整；在该结构中确定由俄罗斯联邦总统领导其活动的机关和由俄罗斯…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u7fd853ca1e0b25dccc-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"в) 决定俄罗斯联邦政府的辞职；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«в»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ubc6bc6f06500bed8c5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"в.1) 接受俄罗斯联邦政府主席、副主席、联邦部长，以及由俄罗斯联邦总统领导其活动的联邦行政机关负责人的辞职；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«в»项 第83条 · “в.1) 接受俄罗斯联邦政府主席、副主席、联邦部长，以及由俄罗斯联邦总统领导其活动的联邦行政机关负责人的辞职；”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0428176e852d97bb36-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"г) 向国家杜马提出俄罗斯联邦中央银行行长的任命人选；向国家杜马提出解除俄罗斯联邦中央银行行长职务的问题；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«г»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uc50c3b5be35e00af63-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"д) 任命经国家杜马批准人选的俄罗斯联邦政府副主席和联邦部长（本条“д.1”项所指的联邦部长除外），并解除其职务；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«д»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6be92415760a286217-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"д.1) 经与联邦委员会协商后，任命主管国防、国家安全、内务、司法、外交、预防紧急情况和消除自然灾害后果以及公共安全事务的联邦行政机关负责人（包括联邦部长），并解除其职务；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«д»项 第83条 · “д.1) 经与联邦委员会协商后，任命主管国防、国家安全、内务、司法、外交、预防紧急情况和消除自然灾害后果以及公共安全事务的联邦行…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ufb3dd9b0fa15551450-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"е) 向联邦委员会提出俄罗斯联邦宪法法院院长、副院长和法官，以及俄罗斯联邦最高法院院长、副院长和法官的任命人选；任命其他联邦法院的院长、副院长和法官；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«е»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0e1f49dc1e8bcbe26e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"е.1) 经与联邦委员会协商后，任命俄罗斯联邦总检察长、副总检察长、俄罗斯联邦主体检察长以及与俄罗斯联邦主体检察长同级的军事和其他专门检察机关检察长，并解除其职务；任免联邦法律规定适用此任免程序的其他检察官；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«е»项 第83条 · “е.1) 经与联邦委员会协商后，任命俄罗斯联邦总检察长、副总检察长、俄罗斯联邦主体检察长以及与俄罗斯联邦主体检察长同级的军事和其…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u96dd5c237bd92ab22c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"е.2) 任免俄罗斯联邦在联邦委员会中的代表<19>；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«е»项 第83条 · “е.2) 任免俄罗斯联邦在联邦委员会中的代表<19>；”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u84d11adc600d237b69-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"е.3) 对俄罗斯联邦宪法法院院长、副院长和法官，俄罗斯联邦最高法院院长、副院长和法官，以及撤销审法院和上诉法院院长、副院长和法官，如其实施有损法官荣誉和尊严的行为，或存在联邦宪法性法律规定的其他表明法官无法行使职权的情形，向联邦委员会提出依联邦宪法性法律终止其职权的提案；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«е»项 第83条 · “е.3) 对俄罗斯联邦宪法法院院长、副院长和法官，俄罗斯联邦最高法院院长、副院长和法官，以及撤销审法院和上诉法院院长、副院长和法…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf542f8b264cd19b993-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"е.4) 向联邦委员会提出审计院院长及审计员总数一半的任命人选；向国家杜马提出审计院副院长及审计员总数一半的任命人选；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«е»项 第83条 · “е.4) 向联邦委员会提出审计院院长及审计员总数一半的任命人选；向国家杜马提出审计院副院长及审计员总数一半的任命人选；”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u77c73f09a3ba32120b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"е.5) 组建俄罗斯联邦国务委员会，以保障公共权力机关协调运作和相互配合，确定俄罗斯联邦内外政策的基本方向及国家社会经济发展的优先方向；俄罗斯联邦国务委员会的地位由联邦法律规定；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«е»项 第83条 · “е.5) 组建俄罗斯联邦国务委员会，以保障公共权力机关协调运作和相互配合，确定俄罗斯联邦内外政策的基本方向及国家社会经济发展的优…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf045b6ed0210664675-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"ж) 组建俄罗斯联邦安全会议，协助国家元首行使有关保障国家利益及个人、社会和国家安全，维护国内公民和平与和睦，保护俄罗斯联邦主权、独立和国家完整，预防内外威胁的职权；领导俄罗斯联邦安全会议。俄罗斯联邦安全会议的地位由联邦法律规定；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«ж»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udcde3eb31d3da1e3fe-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"з) 批准俄罗斯联邦军事学说；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«з»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u7604ba9a8d6ccc7837-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"и) 为保障自身职权的行使，组建俄罗斯联邦总统办公厅；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«и»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u3f8a15cd41ff22126c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"к) 任免俄罗斯联邦总统全权代表；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«к»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u1b9bc345532b65f741-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"л) 任免俄罗斯联邦武装力量最高指挥人员；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«л»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf41a8ed2bf2208235e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"м) 经与联邦会议两院有关委员会或专门委员会协商后，任命和召回俄罗斯联邦驻外国及国际组织的外交代表。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第«м»项 第83条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u40e050b64cef16015c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s93","locator":"第83条","text":"<19> 第83条依据2014年7月21日第11-ФКЗ号《关于俄罗斯联邦联邦会议联邦委员会》的俄罗斯联邦宪法修正法律增补“е.2”项；该法自2014年7月22日正式公布之日起生效（法律信息官方互联网门户网站（www.pravo.gov.ru），2014年7月22日，第0001201407220002号）。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8797c0ff5480db98af51382b6d5800fa84d1c875/","label":"第83条 · “<19> 第83条依据2014年7月21日第11-ФКЗ号《关于俄罗斯联邦联邦会议联邦委员会》的俄罗斯联邦宪法修正法律增补“е.…”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u7774e807b20bea758a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"第84条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第84条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u00c2638b29e70f2411-2","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"俄罗斯联邦总统：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第84条 · “俄罗斯联邦总统：”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2ef185c79db312287e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"а) 依俄罗斯联邦宪法和联邦法律，决定举行国家杜马选举；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第«а»项 第84条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8727c3ef2dd4e8cca4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"б) 在俄罗斯联邦宪法规定的情形下，依其规定程序解散国家杜马；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第«б»项 第84条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6c63eb5b82d172599a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"в) 依联邦宪法性法律规定的程序，决定举行全民公决；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第«в»项 第84条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u822d73e9996e59866b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"г) 向国家杜马提交法律草案；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第«г»项 第84条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf34ef4831ae337d9ae-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"д) 签署并公布联邦法律；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第«д»项 第84条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud7ebc5e0c530bf79d7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s94","locator":"第84条","text":"е) 向联邦会议发表关于国内状况以及国家内外政策基本方向的年度咨文。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/17235ade1dd8189ebc41f6603dcea9c3378e6d5e/","label":"第«е»项 第84条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u4039340204e61d029e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s95","locator":"第85条","text":"第85条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/9476c6b2fb8624d3646b44a31895f307718ba754/","label":"第85条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u649d49eec0f5909b26-1","sectionId":"constitution-s95","locator":"第85条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦总统可以采用调解程序，解决俄罗斯联邦国家权力机关与俄罗斯联邦主体国家权力机关之间，以及俄罗斯联邦主体国家权力机关相互之间的分歧。未能达成一致解决办法时，总统可以将争议提交相应法院审理解决。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/9476c6b2fb8624d3646b44a31895f307718ba754/","label":"第1款 第85条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub778517c442ab4e94b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s95","locator":"第85条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦主体行政机关的文件如与俄罗斯联邦宪法、联邦法律或俄罗斯联邦国际义务相抵触，或者侵犯人和公民的权利与自由，俄罗斯联邦总统有权在相应法院解决该问题之前，中止这些文件的效力。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/9476c6b2fb8624d3646b44a31895f307718ba754/","label":"第2款 第85条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9bd299a59a2981fa2d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s96","locator":"第86条","text":"第86条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/07c015c9de6342fdc9124061bccdc7b1619a211b/","label":"第86条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u00c2638b29e70f2411-3","sectionId":"constitution-s96","locator":"第86条","text":"俄罗斯联邦总统：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/07c015c9de6342fdc9124061bccdc7b1619a211b/","label":"第86条 · “俄罗斯联邦总统：”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u1565c2a078aca3ed0e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s96","locator":"第86条","text":"а) 领导俄罗斯联邦外交政策；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/07c015c9de6342fdc9124061bccdc7b1619a211b/","label":"第«а»项 第86条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub2cf10fee97107b9d4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s96","locator":"第86条","text":"б) 进行谈判并签署俄罗斯联邦国际条约；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/07c015c9de6342fdc9124061bccdc7b1619a211b/","label":"第«б»项 第86条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u4ffe14317a0e93b829-1","sectionId":"constitution-s96","locator":"第86条","text":"в) 签署批准书；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/07c015c9de6342fdc9124061bccdc7b1619a211b/","label":"第«в»项 第86条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u7c7ad2a6a30810c738-1","sectionId":"constitution-s96","locator":"第86条","text":"г) 接受向其派驻的外交代表的国书和召回国书。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/07c015c9de6342fdc9124061bccdc7b1619a211b/","label":"第«г»项 第86条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u80926733e650822963-1","sectionId":"constitution-s97","locator":"第87条","text":"第87条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c09c3f32a65ee6bb978382e9aeb01137229522e2/","label":"第87条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u6e25ef2fdb82616c81-1","sectionId":"constitution-s97","locator":"第87条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦总统是俄罗斯联邦武装力量最高统帅。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c09c3f32a65ee6bb978382e9aeb01137229522e2/","label":"第1款 第87条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud604ed891ccd03e62a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s97","locator":"第87条","text":"2. 发生针对俄罗斯联邦的侵略或存在直接侵略威胁时，俄罗斯联邦总统在俄罗斯联邦全境或个别地区实行军事管制，并立即通知联邦委员会和国家杜马。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c09c3f32a65ee6bb978382e9aeb01137229522e2/","label":"第2款 第87条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u48a9080015ba8fd984-1","sectionId":"constitution-s97","locator":"第87条","text":"3. 军事管制制度由联邦宪法性法律规定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/c09c3f32a65ee6bb978382e9aeb01137229522e2/","label":"第3款 第87条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2c796b3e22dfc4b1b7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s98","locator":"第88条","text":"第88条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/baba1016a3a0d1da60abc333dcca468fef39e2ad/","label":"第88条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-uf143c8e54cdbf66c37-1","sectionId":"constitution-s98","locator":"第88条","text":"俄罗斯联邦总统在联邦宪法性法律规定的情况和程序下，在俄罗斯联邦全境或个别地区实行紧急状态，并立即通知联邦委员会和国家杜马。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/baba1016a3a0d1da60abc333dcca468fef39e2ad/","label":"第88条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue62e4efb612de7ab0c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s99","locator":"第89条","text":"第89条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/db7cffb20b462ebbac91f0139dd89eeb6f5c1df3/","label":"第89条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u00c2638b29e70f2411-4","sectionId":"constitution-s99","locator":"第89条","text":"俄罗斯联邦总统：","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/db7cffb20b462ebbac91f0139dd89eeb6f5c1df3/","label":"第89条 · “俄罗斯联邦总统：”","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u19848f039910faea89-1","sectionId":"constitution-s99","locator":"第89条","text":"а) 决定俄罗斯联邦国籍和提供政治避难事项；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/db7cffb20b462ebbac91f0139dd89eeb6f5c1df3/","label":"第«а»项 第89条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u1ab21370efec2f00e9-1","sectionId":"constitution-s99","locator":"第89条","text":"б) 颁授俄罗斯联邦国家奖励，授予俄罗斯联邦荣誉称号、最高军衔和最高专门衔级；","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/db7cffb20b462ebbac91f0139dd89eeb6f5c1df3/","label":"第«б»项 第89条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud4f8bca52fc7b40f4e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s99","locator":"第89条","text":"в) 实施特赦。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/db7cffb20b462ebbac91f0139dd89eeb6f5c1df3/","label":"第«в»项 第89条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6f10204b72d3a05aec-1","sectionId":"constitution-s100","locator":"第90条","text":"第90条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/35204d468b0900751c311bbff3cb38938b9d141d/","label":"第90条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u50eda76f8dbbf725e5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s100","locator":"第90条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦总统发布总统令和行政指令。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/35204d468b0900751c311bbff3cb38938b9d141d/","label":"第1款 第90条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ueaa3f860d1c15e69f2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s100","locator":"第90条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦总统令和行政指令在俄罗斯联邦全境必须执行。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/35204d468b0900751c311bbff3cb38938b9d141d/","label":"第2款 第90条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ucdc208731f6c976019-1","sectionId":"constitution-s100","locator":"第90条","text":"3. 俄罗斯联邦总统令和行政指令不得与俄罗斯联邦宪法和联邦法律相抵触。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/35204d468b0900751c311bbff3cb38938b9d141d/","label":"第3款 第90条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9bc5798a29582dd038-1","sectionId":"constitution-s101","locator":"第91条","text":"第91条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/cf816a396c722650f2aae5982324fdc1d0aa8a67/","label":"第91条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u1432f2406287af27d7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s101","locator":"第91条","text":"俄罗斯联邦总统享有豁免权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/cf816a396c722650f2aae5982324fdc1d0aa8a67/","label":"第91条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u61b3a745907af810d8-1","sectionId":"constitution-s102","locator":"第92条","text":"第92条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/23d4df0aa402b2458f36c9aa0022a4894c7116a3/","label":"第92条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ub16e3a979909289590-1","sectionId":"constitution-s102","locator":"第92条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦总统自宣誓之时起开始行使职权，并在任期届满、新当选俄罗斯联邦总统宣誓之时起终止行使职权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/23d4df0aa402b2458f36c9aa0022a4894c7116a3/","label":"第1款 第92条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u54d0efdea25c942722-1","sectionId":"constitution-s102","locator":"第92条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦总统辞职、因健康原因持续无法行使其职权或被免除职务时，提前终止行使职权。在此情况下，俄罗斯联邦总统选举必须在提前终止行使职权之日起不迟于三个月内举行。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/23d4df0aa402b2458f36c9aa0022a4894c7116a3/","label":"第2款 第92条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf1518e5a3caa5e5c9c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s102","locator":"第92条","text":"3. 凡俄罗斯联邦总统不能履行职责时，均由俄罗斯联邦政府主席临时代行职责。代行俄罗斯联邦总统职责者，无权解散国家杜马、决定举行全民公决，也无权提出修正和修改俄罗斯联邦宪法条款的建议。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/23d4df0aa402b2458f36c9aa0022a4894c7116a3/","label":"第3款 第92条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ubdb0c5a61f0037c718-1","sectionId":"constitution-s103","locator":"第92.1条","text":"第92.1条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/01e8509815c08c75e45c3fcf43a5f699d1572599/","label":"第92.1条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-udaac83be79f939a2df-1","sectionId":"constitution-s103","locator":"第92.1条","text":"1. 因任期届满，或因辞职、健康原因持续无法行使其职权而提前终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统，享有豁免权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/01e8509815c08c75e45c3fcf43a5f699d1572599/","label":"第1款 第92.1条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u06d319fdc0010d012e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s103","locator":"第92.1条","text":"2. 对因任期届满，或因辞职、健康原因持续无法行使其职权而提前终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统的其他保障，由联邦法律规定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/01e8509815c08c75e45c3fcf43a5f699d1572599/","label":"第2款 第92.1条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ubdeb573cfd48ce494c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s103","locator":"第92.1条","text":"3. 已终止行使职权的俄罗斯联邦总统，可以依俄罗斯联邦宪法第93条规定的程序被剥夺豁免权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/01e8509815c08c75e45c3fcf43a5f699d1572599/","label":"第3款 第92.1条","heading":false}]}
